In article <3CE96936.8000602@home.nl>, Dirk Munk <munk@home.nl> wrote:

> Will DCPS support all HP postscript printers, incl. Inkjet etc. ?

We've made no decisions about expanding DCPS support from the networked
laser lines (Color LaserJet and LaserJet) that we now support.  Once
DCPS V2.1 ships, we'll review what to do and add for the next version. 
Expanding support to as many HP printers as possible certainly makes
sense now that DCPS is HP software.

> And will we be able to use a supported USB interface as well for DCPS 
> (from VMS 7.3-1)?

Although DCPS Engineering was consulted in the original USB design by
OpenVMS Engineering a few years ago, there are no plans to add USB
support to DCPS.  We are unsure if there is a demand for such a thing. 
Are you asking because you have a need for DCPS on USB?

Paul

