>
> Newsgroup line:
> comp.os.ms-windows.nt.alpha Windows NT on DEC/Compaq Alpha processors.
>
> RATIONALE: comp.os.ms-windows.nt.alpha
>
> The unmoderated forum comp.os.linux.alpha has been the only newsgroup
> for Alpha Processor using people for a long time. Due to the rising
> popularity of Windows and other Microsoft products on Alphas, the linux
> newsgroup has lost its focus. This newsgroup would give people with
> MS-Alpha related questions a place to go, since Microsoft itself refuses
> to support the Alpha Processor after dropping it in 1999. There is a large
> amount of traffic involving Windows NT on the linux newsgroup, about 1 of
> the 3 to 5 messages posted daily is about Windows.
>
> CHARTER: comp.os.ms-windows.nt.alpha
>
> This newsgroup will be dedicated to helping Windows/Alpha users answer
> their questions and share ideas. Due to the nature of the posters, I do
> not feel that moderation will be necessary.
>
> END CHARTER.
>
